		(property "Description" "Hirose U.FL-R-SMT-1(10), fed by a pigtail to a bulkhead SMA on the jig. The same part on all six boards, so the launch is not a variable. Put a ferrite or a sleeve balun on the pigtail: on a plane this size the cable braid is part of the antenna until you choke it"
			(at 63.5 88.9 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))
		)
